cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you cite this work, please use the metadata below."
title: "Hamlet Pop-Upper"
abstract: >
  A born-digital work by Mohammad Zare (Mozare) in which the fixed dramaturgical
  score of Hamlet's deaths meets one recurring questioning interface; the visitor's
  answers change how the apparatus meets each death, never what dies or when.
